  "id": "chickpea-fritters",
  "name": "Chickpea Fritters",
  "subtitle": "Crisp vegetable-and-chickpea patties with cucumber yogurt",
  "description": "Blend chickpeas with vegetables, spices, and egg, shape into small patties, and pan-fry until crisp and fully set. Serve with a cool cucumber sauce.",
